  questTitle: The Economy for the People
  description: The government claims a new economic initiative will benefit the citizens,
    but it's just another way to enrich corporations. Expose the lies and shift public
    opinion.
  <QuestReward>k__BackingField: 0
  <questObjectives>k__BackingField:
  - isDone: 0
    targetValue: 10
    progressValue: 0
    objectiveType: 1
    description: Destroy 10 "Economic Propaganda Bots" that promote the initiative
      as a success.
  - isDone: 0
    targetValue: 5
    progressValue: 0
    objectiveType: 2
    description: "Change the minds of 5 NPCs (who support the government\u2019s economic
      policy) by providing evidence that the policy harms the majority of the population."
  - isDone: 0
    targetValue: 6
    progressValue: 0
    objectiveType: 0
    description: Investigate and counter 6 posts that spread false information about
      the economic initiative.
